            <ArticleTitle>A successful conservative approach to managing lower leg pain in a university sports injury clinic: a two patient case study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>233-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There is a lack of information on the conservative treatment of lower leg pain induced by running. In this study, non-invasive treatment based on a change of footwear was applied to two patients, and, on the basis of pain scale questionnaires, deemed successful.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
